  "description": "The Myers are out of luck. Not only did the tyrant emperor strip them of their title and land, but Alexis, the head of the family, took his own life because of it... And no one's more shocked than his wife, Louise, when he suddenly wakes up a completely different person! But Louise doesn't realize that Alexis has been possessed by a hero from another world, one who's determined to save the Myers once and for all. Can the new Alexis become the family's savior? Or will he be rejected as a fake?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
